  "prefLabel": "Plc 1905.04 Application for LSP Certification Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1905.04 Application for LSP Certification Renewal. A certificant who wishes to maintain state LSP certification under RSA 310-A:222 and Plc 1900 shall apply for renewal by complying with Plc 308.05, subject to the following:\n\n(a) The applicant shall provide a copy of the applicant’s qualifying certification pursuant to Plc 308.07(b); and\n\n(b) The fee shall be the application processing and licensing fee specified in Plc 1002.55, provided that an applicant who is applying as active military or a military spouse shall not pay the fee.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1900.html"
